  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work on innovative approaches to media, development of the use of social media and promote digital tools. It will also foster internal communication by facilitating information sharing about activities and institutional changes. The project will also support content gathering through documentation in order to feed different media. Finally, project will have a strong capacity building and networking components.</narrative>
